## 1. Test Objectives

1. Validate that the **Freemium (Netflix-style)** subscription model correctly gates content.
2. Verify all **CRUD** operations for Courses, Materials, Lessons, and Q&A.
3. Confirm **Firestore Security Rules** prevent unauthorized reads/writes.
4. Ensure **Admin gatekeeping** (teacher approval, user management, subscription override) works end-to-end.
5. Validate **UI/UX** adherence to the Frenchify Design System (colors, typography, responsiveness).
6. Confirm **media** workflows: YouTube embedding, file uploads (audio/video/PDF).

---

## 2. Entry & Exit Criteria

### Entry Criteria
- Build compiles without errors (`npm run build` passes).
- Firebase Emulator Suite starts successfully.
- Test user accounts exist: Free Student, Paid Student, Approved Teacher, Unapproved Teacher, Admin.

### Exit Criteria
- All **Critical** and **High** severity test cases pass.
- No open **Blocker** or **Critical** defects.
- Security test cases (SEC-*) all pass.
- UI spot-checks on mobile (375 px) and desktop (1440 px) pass.

