## 5. Defect Severity Definitions

| Severity    | Definition                                                         |
|-------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Blocker** | System crash, data loss, or security breach. No workaround.        |
| **Critical**| Core feature broken (login, payment gating, content access).       |
| **Major**   | Feature works but with significant issues (broken layout, missing validation). |
| **Minor**   | Cosmetic issues, typos, minor UX inconveniences.                   |

