## 6. Risks & Assumptions

| Risk                                         | Mitigation                                               |
|----------------------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------|
| Firestore rules allow any auth user to create courses (SEC-05) | Flag for development fix; restrict to teacher/admin roles |
| Stripe integration not yet implemented       | Payment tests deferred to Phase 3                        |
| Simultaneous login detection not finalized   | AUTH-04 marked as conditional based on implementation    |
| No automated E2E test suite yet              | Manual regression for MVP; recommend Cypress post-launch |

